invariant: INV-7
file: srv_kex.c
catches: srv_flight_test
reason: the server selects by key share rather than by supported_groups, so
  a client that lists X25519MLKEM768 and shares x25519 alone gets x25519
  in one round trip instead of the HelloRetryRequest that asks for the
  hybrid. docs/decisions.md 54 spends that round trip on purpose, and
  test_flight_select_group requires the hybrid with need_retry set for
  that hello.

--- old
    if ((ch->groups & SRV_GROUP_X25519MLKEM768) != 0) {
        return CH_GROUP_X25519MLKEM768;
    }
--- new
    if ((ch->groups & SRV_GROUP_X25519MLKEM768) != 0 &&
        ((ch->shares & SRV_GROUP_X25519MLKEM768) != 0 || (ch->shares & SRV_GROUP_X25519) == 0)) {
        return CH_GROUP_X25519MLKEM768;
    }
